{"name": "Cult of Shadows", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/extras/4ddd9893b44b769a1169c1b6e7e12fcd.poster.avif?t=1784326613\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/extras/4ddd9893b44b769a1169c1b6e7e12fcd.webm?t=1784326613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/extras/4ddd9893b44b769a1169c1b6e7e12fcd.mp4?t=1784326613\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cult of Shadows is a dynamic action game combining elements of Hack and Slash and roguelite genres based on player skills. Fight hordes of enemies and gain experience. Strengthen your character and skills. Defeat cultists and the Mithos they summon. Collect and upgrade items, obtain unique items, and use them to fight in dark arenas and procedurally generated dungeons. Learn the behaviors of your opponents. Unlock new heroes and try out new builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/extras/4771d95df0f5d2f5fdedff603350c5ce.poster.avif?t=1784326613\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/extras/4771d95df0f5d2f5fdedff603350c5ce.webm?t=1784326613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/extras/4771d95df0f5d2f5fdedff603350c5ce.mp4?t=1784326613\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What can you expect in Cult of Shadows?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fighting large numbers of enemies simultaneously,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mighty beasts to defeat,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improving your character's attributes and skills,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of dying and coming back,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collecting items\u2014common, magical, blessed or cursed, and unique,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrading your items,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fighting in arenas and procedurally generated dungeons,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a challenging game that focuses on the player's skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/extras_big/7817efa668516be7e330bf644a355b93.webp?t=1784326613\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/extras/7817efa668516be7e330bf644a355b93.avif?t=1784326613\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What will you find in the game?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 unique levels,</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 procedurally generated dungeons,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 playable characters with unique skills,</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Uncover the secrets of Bel Noa. Fight hordes of cultists and the Mythos they summon. Defeat fearsome beasts, upgrade your character, acquire and enchant weapons. Die and return stronger to face the Cult of Shadows.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/fb30b336345ec492916c3e84eb923dad8b794d17/head